{"candidate_id":"online-6868822a9e482a75","operation":"REWRITE","target_chunk_id":"chunk-1f8d27322e9f","source_card_ids":["failure-train-group-000000715-sample-000005728-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000000733-sample-000005872-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000000744-sample-000005960-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000000864-sample-000006920-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000000996-sample-000007976-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000001096-sample-000008776-full-skill-retry-01"],"failure_mechanism":"商品详情页规格选择时未精确复制可点击元素的完整选项文本（包括空格、特殊字符），或商品标题与任务要求表面冲突时过早排除商品而未检查规格选项变体","proposal_checkpoint":"qwen35-4b-round-001","stage":"online","consolidation_cluster_id":"cluster-6868822a9e482a75","replacement_family_id":"chunk-1f8d27322e9f","content":"### 候选验证 - 规格选项精确匹配与深度检查\n\n- Applies when: 商品详情页存在规格选择轴且需要点击特定规格选项时，或商品标题与任务核心约束表面不一致但商品类别匹配时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 从可点击元素列表中直接复制完整的规格选项文本，包括所有空格和特殊字符\n  2. 使用该完整文本执行点击操作，不自行构造或修改\n  3. 若商品标题与任务要求表面冲突，点击进入详情页检查规格选项是否包含符合要求的变体\n  4. 确认规格选项明确标注符合任务要求的特征后再做购买决策\n- Verify: 点击后规格状态显示'已选择'且 missing_option_axes 中不再包含该规格轴，或确认所选规格选项的关键属性与任务要求一致\n- Avoid: 自行构造选项文本导致格式不匹配，或仅依赖商品标题判断匹配度而未检查规格选项变体","validation_result":"selected","estimated_effect":0.022425922121432726,"contribution_rank":4,"notes":null,"evaluation_checkpoint":"round-001-checkpoint","validation_estimator":"paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept","bare_validation_observations_sha256":"7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa","intervention_id":"online-6868822a9e482a75","pool_sha256":"a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6","assignment_sha256":"bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16","validation_history":[{"proposal_checkpoint":"qwen35-4b-round-001","evaluation_checkpoint":"round-001-checkpoint","validation_estimator":"paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept","bare_validation_observations_sha256":"7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd7