{"candidate_id":"online-fec6c929a99f4485","operation":"REWRITE","target_chunk_id":"chunk-c83ed5ae8b70","source_card_ids":["failure-train-group-000001231-sample-000009856-full-skill-retry-01","failure-train-group-000001277-sample-000010224-full-skill-retry-01"],"failure_mechanism":"商品存在多个规格选项时未验证各规格对应的具体价格即做出选择，或任务包含定制需求时未识别规格选项中的'定制'关键词与任务需求的对应关系","proposal_checkpoint":"qwen35-4b-round-001","stage":"online","consolidation_cluster_id":"cluster-fec6c929a99f4485","replacement_family_id":"chunk-c83ed5ae8b70","content":"### 购买决策 - 价格与定制约束协同验证\n\n- Applies when: 任务包含明确价格上限约束且商品存在多个规格选项导致价格差异时，或任务指令包含'定制'需求且有明确预算约束且商品规格选项中存在含'定制'关键词的选项时\n- Procedure:\n  1. 识别所有与任务需求相关的规格选项\n  2. 逐一检查各规格选项对应的具体价格\n  3. 筛选出价格满足预算约束的选项\n  4. 若任务包含定制需求，在商品规格选项中查找包含'定制'关键词的选项并优先选择\n  5. 验证所选规格的价格是否在预算范围内\n- Verify: 确认所选规格选项的价格严格小于任务指定的价格上限，且若任务含定制需求则规格名称包含'定制'关键词\n- Avoid: 未验证规格价格即选择导致选择超出预算的规格选项，或仅关注功能属性匹配而忽略规格选项中的'定制'关键词","validation_result":"selected","estimated_effect":0.07611594067371895,"contribution_rank":1,"notes":null,"evaluation_checkpoint":"round-001-checkpoint","validation_estimator":"paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept","bare_validation_observations_sha256":"7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa","intervention_id":"online-fec6c929a99f4485","pool_sha256":"a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6","assignment_sha256":"bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced513f911fb92212d800ac0291cea758a7c16","validation_history":[{"proposal_checkpoint":"qwen35-4b-round-001","evaluation_checkpoint":"round-001-checkpoint","validation_estimator":"paired_delta_ols_main_effects_no_intercept","bare_validation_observations_sha256":"7fe13268eec6f6a18bbcbc39afcde2c3ea821ed3d80f1fb70bd753b144e1deaa","intervention_id":"online-fec6c929a99f4485","validation_result":"selected","estimated_effect":0.07611594067371895,"contribution_rank":1,"pool_sha256":"a6b930a73f63472e8b2857c5201f7d3506f190f3f979aa0f9cd866e61d0ea6c6","assignment_sha256":"bdd89685e3b8dc32ce83053f06ced